WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.020
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.860
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.860 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.020
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.530 --> 00:58.300
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.300 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.010
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.010 --> 01:08.860
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.860 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.530 --> 01:25.180
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.850 --> 01:43.210
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.509 --> 01:46.830
=Episode 8=

01:50.320 --> 01:54.360
Time to eat.

01:58.759 --> 01:59.880
Okay, just a second.

02:01.800 --> 02:03.040
Come on.

02:04.960 --> 02:06.160
Shifang, what do you want?

02:08.800 --> 02:10.979
Shifang, which one do you want?

02:10.979 --> 02:12.000
Still this one?

02:16.160 --> 02:17.520
Sir, what would you like to eat?

02:18.120 --> 02:19.280
I'll wait for the others.

02:19.280 --> 02:20.370
Alright.

02:21.920 --> 02:24.120
Zhaoyan, come sit.

03:04.680 --> 03:05.740
What are you doing?

03:06.360 --> 03:07.410
Enjoying the flowers.

03:20.079 --> 03:21.920
Jinzhao, come eat.

03:23.840 --> 03:25.160
Shopkeeper, we're ready to order.

03:26.200 --> 03:27.250
Coming.

03:29.640 --> 03:32.560
Would you like meat or vegetables?

03:32.560 --> 03:34.120
Meat. He'll pay.

03:35.920 --> 03:38.640
No need. Just bring us all of
your best specialties.

03:38.640 --> 03:39.730
Okay.

03:40.600 --> 03:42.680
Wait. Two shares of each.

03:42.680 --> 03:43.760
Okay.

03:45.520 --> 03:48.600
Shopkeeper, there are mosquitoes here.

03:48.600 --> 03:49.840
Light some mugwort.

03:51.440 --> 03:52.720
Yes, right away.

03:59.160 --> 04:00.240
Little Yue.

04:01.400 --> 04:03.840
(Design drawing)
You wanted Dou Bao to shoot flames.

04:03.840 --> 04:06.320
I worked on the design
all night yesterday. Look.

04:08.080 --> 04:11.320
You are in good mood
as a prisoner, Physician Bian.

04:12.560 --> 04:14.380
This flower is called Yexiang.

04:14.380 --> 04:16.680
When the flowers bloom,

04:16.680 --> 04:18.800
its branches and leaves
have a calming effect.

04:18.800 --> 04:21.440
Would you like to try, Xian Qing?

04:24.080 --> 04:25.680
No, thank you.

04:34.600 --> 04:35.630
Look.

04:37.880 --> 04:39.840
(Dou Bao Flamer II, Charm)
Here, and here.

04:41.680 --> 04:44.040
Excuse me, are you all
staying for the night?

04:46.159 --> 04:47.400
No, we just eat…

04:51.600 --> 04:54.040
Zhaoyan?

04:54.560 --> 04:55.600
Zhaoyan, are you okay?

04:58.040 --> 04:59.060
How are you?

05:02.960 --> 05:04.840
It's nothing. I just need to rest a bit.

05:05.840 --> 05:07.520
It's not good to be stubborn.

05:08.680 --> 05:09.760
We should stay and rest.

05:10.320 --> 05:13.040
We have only three rooms left.
You'll have to share.

05:18.400 --> 05:19.860
Zhaoyan is not feeling well.

05:19.860 --> 05:21.920
I'll take care of him.
We share one room.

05:21.920 --> 05:22.400
Senior.

05:22.400 --> 05:23.160
Come.

05:23.160 --> 05:24.760
Senior…

05:27.440 --> 05:28.440
Please follow me.

05:39.640 --> 05:40.690
It has nothing to do with me.

05:41.360 --> 05:43.240
Your saying doesn't count.

05:43.240 --> 05:45.280
Shifang, follow him.

05:45.280 --> 05:47.080
Okay, let's go.

05:58.520 --> 06:00.200
Zhaoyan suffers from an illness,

06:00.200 --> 06:02.160
yet he was so strong on the journey.

06:02.160 --> 06:03.720
He's worthy to be
the master of Luo family.

06:04.480 --> 06:07.520
He was fine before,
but fell ill twice today.

06:09.800 --> 06:11.400
Is it because he got too tired?

06:25.440 --> 06:27.980
I can give you other flowers,
but not this one.

06:45.480 --> 06:46.510
Senior.

06:48.880 --> 06:51.409
I have something to discuss with you.
Let's talk outside.

07:04.800 --> 07:07.320
Stay put here. Don't try any tricks.

07:14.840 --> 07:16.920
Ju, care for some tea?

07:18.560 --> 07:21.080
I will not accept an enemy's kindness.

07:30.160 --> 07:32.840
Aren't you tired for
staring at me all the time?

07:33.680 --> 07:35.720
Jinzhao gave me this task.

07:35.720 --> 07:37.240
I cannot fail him.

08:04.000 --> 08:05.230
Maiming.

08:05.870 --> 08:06.900
Zhaoyan.

08:08.280 --> 08:13.400
The curse acted up today.
You had to suffer with me.

08:15.120 --> 08:16.300
It's alright.

08:17.840 --> 08:19.160
Your days are numbered.

08:20.920 --> 08:23.400
Aren't you looking to lift the curse?

08:30.280 --> 08:34.480
You won't change your mind,
and neither will I.

08:34.480 --> 08:35.500
Zhaoyan.

08:37.960 --> 08:38.990
Let's talk later.

08:41.799 --> 08:42.799
Zhaoyan?

08:51.000 --> 08:56.200
Zhaoyan?
You do call her quite affectionately.

08:58.440 --> 08:59.540
Zhaoyan?

09:03.640 --> 09:05.280
Senior, I am fine now.

09:05.800 --> 09:08.400
I just need to rest for a bit.

09:13.040 --> 09:15.680
Xiu is here, let her have a look.

09:21.680 --> 09:24.840
Jinzhao, why can't we talk in the room

09:24.840 --> 09:25.960
and have to go here?

09:26.640 --> 09:27.760
There could be someone listening.

09:29.720 --> 09:31.560
Bian Luohuan left this last night.

09:37.760 --> 09:39.880
The same pattern as my hair cord.

09:41.320 --> 09:43.720
I suspect he has something
to do with your background.

09:45.920 --> 09:47.920
No wonder I feel that

09:47.920 --> 09:51.440
he somewhat resembles
the master in my dreams.

09:55.280 --> 09:59.560
Qi, how about we test him tonight?

10:36.160 --> 10:38.880
You are physically weak
and just need to rest well.

10:39.960 --> 10:41.010
Thank you, Miss Ming.

10:42.080 --> 10:43.600
Take some rest then, Zhaoyan.

10:44.800 --> 10:45.840
Thank you, Senior.

11:08.880 --> 11:12.600
Xiu, it seemed you had more to say.

11:15.800 --> 11:18.920
Luo Zhaoyan's vitality is
continuously diminishing,

11:19.520 --> 11:21.960
like being devoured by something.

11:22.920 --> 11:27.320
Rather than a chronic disease,
it's more like a curse.

11:30.080 --> 11:33.920
Is the early demise of the Luo family's
twins related to a curse?

11:34.800 --> 11:37.760
When I cast the spell on her,

11:37.760 --> 11:39.840
I noticed you transferred
your energy to her again.

11:41.160 --> 11:42.760
Uncle, do not forget

11:42.760 --> 11:46.120
that you almost died
for her 20 years ago.

11:47.600 --> 11:50.400
I've spent my centennial energy
on her and her brother.

11:50.400 --> 11:54.920
I don't want to let her just die.

11:56.000 --> 11:57.000
Is that all?

12:00.800 --> 12:03.480
A thousand-year-old wolf demon
who claims to be without desires.

12:03.480 --> 12:06.200
Why do you care so much
about Luo Zhaoyan?

12:08.040 --> 12:11.520
A thousand years of having no desires
is exactly why one seeks fun.

12:13.600 --> 12:15.360
This is your affair, not mine.

12:16.400 --> 12:17.490
I'm just reminding you.

12:18.740 --> 12:21.640
Don't get injured and
make my master worry.

12:25.080 --> 12:27.640
You grew up with Hanjiang.

12:28.760 --> 12:31.800
Why do you only talk about the master?

12:33.560 --> 12:35.080
Ming Xiu, you came.

12:36.400 --> 12:38.520
Senior Xian Qing, is Zhaoyan alright?

12:38.520 --> 12:40.600
Yes, he just needs to rest well.

12:41.200 --> 12:42.290
The thing you asked for.

12:43.380 --> 12:44.400
Thank you.

12:44.400 --> 12:45.420
What is this?

12:45.420 --> 12:47.720
Secret. Let's go.
We can switch shifts now.

12:49.040 --> 12:50.060
See you.

12:56.480 --> 12:58.040
Don't forget what I told you.

12:58.040 --> 13:00.080
If anything happens, remember to use…

13:00.080 --> 13:01.200
Mindlink.

13:02.200 --> 13:04.000
Are you hungry? Want some egg noodles?

13:05.600 --> 13:06.610
Go.

13:13.200 --> 13:15.630
(Fengyan Inn)

13:24.200 --> 13:26.040
Miss Yue, would you like to play?

13:31.200 --> 13:32.240
Sure.

13:51.560 --> 13:54.440
Your style of play is indeed unique.

14:15.360 --> 14:21.080
Physician Bian,
did you leave this at the Luo's?

14:25.800 --> 14:26.900
It's not mine.

14:27.680 --> 14:28.720
You're lying.

14:29.320 --> 14:32.320
Jinzhao said
he saw this straw-woven fish

14:32.320 --> 14:33.840
falling from you.

14:36.640 --> 14:39.040
Then why did you ask?

14:41.240 --> 14:45.720
Because you resemble someone
I know from my dreams.

14:47.000 --> 14:50.480
There's someone in my dreams
whose face I can't see.

14:51.720 --> 14:55.520
He wears the same style
of clothing as yours.

14:56.040 --> 14:58.760
But in my dreams, he's very good to me.

14:59.760 --> 15:02.600
He teaches me swordsmanship and wisdom.

15:05.080 --> 15:09.840
So I wonder if he could be my master.

15:20.440 --> 15:21.480
Everyone has dreams.

15:22.320 --> 15:24.800
If everyone took their dreams
as real like you,

15:25.800 --> 15:27.760
it'd be in total disarray.

15:27.760 --> 15:30.520
No. I'm certain I have a master.

15:32.840 --> 15:34.440
This was given to me by my master.

15:34.440 --> 15:36.440
It's woven just like
your straw-woven fish.

15:51.520 --> 15:55.120
Is your master important to you?

16:01.400 --> 16:03.020
The master in my dream

16:04.440 --> 16:08.110
is very warm and kind.

16:09.800 --> 16:11.720
He must be very important.

16:14.400 --> 16:18.760
And more importantly,
as long as I find my master,

16:18.760 --> 16:20.880
Jinzhao and I will be able to resolve…

16:23.960 --> 16:27.600
Resolve…

16:30.160 --> 16:31.480
Have you thought about this?

16:32.560 --> 16:35.880
If your master comes looking for you,

16:38.240 --> 16:39.360
will you go with him?

16:40.430 --> 16:46.670
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

16:48.370 --> 16:55.090
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

16:56.590 --> 17:03.440
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

17:04.319 --> 17:07.040
I'm hungry. Why isn't Jinzhao here yet?

17:11.760 --> 17:14.359
It seems Yue is really good to you.

17:15.359 --> 17:20.160
Good? Jinzhao is a real penny-pincher.

17:20.160 --> 17:22.760
He always nags me for
spending too much money.

17:22.760 --> 17:25.359
And he always calls me
a gluttonous fish.

17:26.680 --> 17:29.760
Every time I have egg noodles,

17:29.760 --> 17:31.320
he always snatches my eggs.

17:36.440 --> 17:40.520
Jinzhao, why are you standing here?

17:53.680 --> 17:56.200
Qi, let's go out to eat.

17:57.600 --> 17:58.960
I haven't finished yet.

17:58.960 --> 18:00.430
Physician Bian, tell me.

18:00.430 --> 18:02.800
Where did you get this straw-woven fish?

18:07.000 --> 18:08.720
Everyone in my hometown can make it.

18:09.480 --> 18:12.160
The pattern is all the same.

18:21.200 --> 18:23.440
Jinzhao.

19:34.680 --> 19:36.960
Jinzhao, are you angry?

19:42.360 --> 19:45.640
I was just joking.
There are a lot of "buts".

19:48.720 --> 19:49.780
But what?

19:52.440 --> 19:55.080
But Jinzhao is very smart.

19:55.080 --> 19:57.800
He can solve all problems.

19:58.840 --> 20:00.080
Jinzhao is very brave.

20:00.080 --> 20:01.680
No matter what danger arises,

20:01.680 --> 20:04.200
he is always the first to protect me.

20:08.600 --> 20:11.040
Although Jinzhao is very stingy,

20:11.800 --> 20:14.840
as long as he has one copper coin,

20:14.840 --> 20:18.360
he will buy me egg noodles
and take me to see the flower sea

20:18.360 --> 20:20.160
and the glowing butterflies.

20:27.000 --> 20:29.720
Jinzhao, don't be angry, okay?

20:30.880 --> 20:32.960
I'm not angry. Why should I?

20:33.720 --> 20:36.320
You're lying. You are angry.

20:43.760 --> 20:44.880
Well, I am not angry now.

20:47.880 --> 20:49.040
How did your questioning go?

20:50.160 --> 20:51.220
What?

20:53.600 --> 20:55.280
Is Bian Luohuan your master or not?

20:57.760 --> 21:01.280
I think he isn't.

21:01.280 --> 21:02.560
You heard it too.

21:03.200 --> 21:07.520
That straw-woven fish is common
in his hometown.

21:13.160 --> 21:14.640
I should have asked him myself.

21:15.680 --> 21:17.440
The straw-woven fish
doesn't prove anything.

21:25.440 --> 21:26.540
Qi.

21:30.560 --> 21:34.320
Is it important to find
the master in your dream?

21:35.000 --> 21:39.320
Of course, haven't we been
searching for our origins?

21:40.680 --> 21:43.760
What will you do after
you find your origins?

21:47.280 --> 21:52.640
Jinzhao, you're acting weird.
What do you mean?

21:55.600 --> 21:57.460
♪When insomnia sets in♪

21:57.460 --> 22:00.020
♪No longer treading on eggshells♪

22:00.680 --> 22:04.120
If one day you find
the master in your dreams,

22:07.000 --> 22:08.040
will you go with him?

22:10.560 --> 22:11.600
(Have you thought about this?)

22:12.840 --> 22:16.200
(If your master comes looking for you,)

22:18.680 --> 22:19.840
(will you go with him?)

22:20.530 --> 22:22.450
♪Scattered by the crowds♪

22:22.450 --> 22:27.760
♪We are like being
at the two ends of the outcome♪

22:28.300 --> 22:31.280
♪Separated by a sea♪

22:31.280 --> 22:33.100
♪The wind still blows♪

22:33.100 --> 22:35.890
♪Pushing memories to the shore♪

22:35.890 --> 22:38.450
♪I can't walk out of the memories♪

22:39.000 --> 22:40.820
♪The longing is hard to endure♪

22:40.820 --> 22:43.250
♪Yet you are not here♪

22:43.250 --> 22:47.820
♪I watch time reverse and grow distant♪

22:47.820 --> 22:50.830
♪And dialogues get unfamiliar♪

22:50.830 --> 22:54.900
♪If time could pause for me♪

22:54.900 --> 22:56.560
♪At the crossroads of parting♪

22:57.200 --> 22:59.000
How did I suddenly get a fever?

22:59.600 --> 23:03.060
♪This time I'll turn back first♪

23:05.720 --> 23:06.770
Zhaoyan.

23:12.040 --> 23:13.240
I asked the shopkeeper for ice.

23:13.880 --> 23:16.240
It'll help lower your temperature.

23:36.080 --> 23:37.170
Do it yourself.

23:38.800 --> 23:39.820
Thank you, Senior.

23:46.840 --> 23:48.840
I talked to Jinzhao and the others.

23:48.840 --> 23:50.200
We'll set off later tomorrow.

23:51.080 --> 23:53.680
No need, I'm much better now.

23:53.680 --> 23:55.040
Don't let me slow you down.

23:55.040 --> 23:57.800
I said it's not good to be stubborn.

23:58.760 --> 23:59.860
You need rest.

24:02.040 --> 24:04.160
Rest…

24:28.520 --> 24:29.800
I feel much better now.

24:30.760 --> 24:33.080
Senior, you take the bed.
I'll sleep on the floor.

24:48.120 --> 24:51.360
I just noticed the moonlight
is beautiful tonight.

24:52.360 --> 24:53.420
I want to go out for a walk.

24:54.080 --> 24:56.840
Don't wait up for me. Go sleep.

25:42.840 --> 25:44.320
Ming Xiu.

25:44.320 --> 25:45.360
Are you hungry?

25:48.160 --> 25:51.200
I don't think about food all the time.

25:56.040 --> 25:57.080
What happened?

26:01.040 --> 26:02.640
Jinzhao just asked me

26:04.240 --> 26:06.280
if I'll go with the master in my dreams

26:07.000 --> 26:08.240
when I find him.

26:10.720 --> 26:11.760
How did you answer?

26:15.160 --> 26:16.160
I don't know.

26:17.080 --> 26:20.800
I've never thought about that.

26:21.640 --> 26:24.560
Why would Jinzhao ask
such a strange question?

26:26.880 --> 26:27.920
People become insecure

26:30.200 --> 26:32.200
when it comes to someone important.

26:47.280 --> 26:48.880
Where did this dog come from?

26:55.240 --> 26:56.520
Bark.

26:56.520 --> 26:57.760
I'll give you a chicken leg.

26:58.720 --> 27:00.800
It likes spicy food.

27:01.520 --> 27:02.610
Really?

27:03.960 --> 27:04.980
Yeah.

27:06.360 --> 27:09.360
Bark and I'll give you
the spiciest chicken leg.

27:13.960 --> 27:15.720
Why would a dog meow like a cat?

27:21.280 --> 27:25.080
- Mother.
- Mother.

27:25.080 --> 27:26.080
- Mother.
- Mother.

27:27.200 --> 27:29.160
You are cruel, Xiu.

27:29.160 --> 27:30.640
You know I hate spicy food.

27:32.480 --> 27:35.800
Human younglings are such nuisances.

27:37.360 --> 27:41.320
Right, humans can never be
as interesting as your Zhaoyan.

27:42.000 --> 27:43.090
That's for sure.

29:44.280 --> 29:47.120
(Fengyan Inn)

29:52.680 --> 29:53.680
Good morning, everyone.

29:53.680 --> 29:54.280
Morning.

29:54.280 --> 29:55.310
Morning.

29:59.160 --> 30:01.960
Zhaoyan, did you rest well last night?

30:03.240 --> 30:04.600
He must do.

30:04.600 --> 30:06.840
There was a watchdog last night

30:06.840 --> 30:08.600
guarding at Master Luo's door.

30:11.800 --> 30:14.720
Senior Xian Qing, where did you go
last night? You didn't come back.

30:16.840 --> 30:17.970
Sorry, Senior.

30:20.960 --> 30:22.320
You are always so courteous.

30:28.440 --> 30:31.630
Alright, let's go.

30:46.560 --> 30:47.700
Stop!

30:49.920 --> 30:52.280
You think you can leave so easily?

30:59.040 --> 31:02.800
How dare you lot kidnap Didact?

31:03.920 --> 31:05.400
Release him now,

31:05.400 --> 31:08.320
and I'll spare you three savages.

31:08.320 --> 31:09.800
There are seven of them.

31:09.800 --> 31:11.440
You seven savages.

31:11.440 --> 31:13.680
My lord, Didact is among them too.

31:13.680 --> 31:14.960
Didact as well.

31:16.240 --> 31:18.000
Shut up.

31:19.520 --> 31:21.800
We do have a dog here though.

31:21.800 --> 31:23.760
Don't be naughty, Xiu.

31:23.760 --> 31:25.360
Disappear, scram.

31:26.680 --> 31:29.440
Didact, we are here to rescue you.

31:33.280 --> 31:37.280
They call you Didact. Do you still
deny your ties with the Qiyuan Sect?

31:37.280 --> 31:40.120
You lied. You are a bad person
from the Qiyuan Sect.

31:40.800 --> 31:44.360
Miss Yue, can one really
tell good from bad?

31:45.760 --> 31:48.880
You brat, that's dangerous.

31:48.880 --> 31:50.400
Put your sword down.

31:50.400 --> 31:53.000
If you release him, I might spare you.

31:53.000 --> 31:56.480
Otherwise, I'll show you
you are playing with fire.

31:56.480 --> 31:57.560
And asking for your death.

31:57.560 --> 31:58.800
And asking for your death!

31:59.520 --> 32:00.520
I told you to disappear.

32:00.520 --> 32:01.240
Right.

32:01.240 --> 32:02.480
Your death, you mean!

32:03.560 --> 32:06.240
Why have you captured so many people?

32:06.240 --> 32:10.240
Do you expect these
disciples to save you?

32:12.520 --> 32:15.000
Physician Bian, why are you silent?

32:16.520 --> 32:17.640
Is there something on your mind?

32:18.400 --> 32:21.280
Let me guess. Are you wondering

32:21.280 --> 32:25.000
how come the poison
on us hasn't acted yet?

32:27.000 --> 32:29.680
You sprinkled Mingxin Fragrance
on the flowers' pistils, right?

32:31.520 --> 32:32.530
Look at this flower.

32:37.200 --> 32:39.200
Bian Luohuan was holding
this very flower.

32:40.520 --> 32:41.880
Is there something suspicious?

32:42.640 --> 32:44.760
I compared this flower's
pistil with others.

32:45.320 --> 32:47.400
This one has clearly more pollens.

32:51.440 --> 32:52.760
Bian Luohuan is skilled in medicine.

32:53.640 --> 32:56.080
Did he sprinkle these pollens?

32:56.720 --> 33:00.320
I think so. Moreover, there are
no mosquitoes in this Inn,

33:00.320 --> 33:02.800
but he asked the manager
to light up the mugwort.

33:06.440 --> 33:08.040
I'll send a message to Xiu

33:08.040 --> 33:10.600
and have her find out
what kind of poison

33:10.600 --> 33:12.640
is related to the mugwort.

33:12.640 --> 33:14.280
I'll ask her bring the antidote.

33:14.280 --> 33:16.680
We should notify the others too.

33:20.880 --> 33:23.000
Mingxin Fragrance combined with mugwort

33:24.440 --> 33:26.480
will affect the person within a day.

33:26.480 --> 33:30.040
Once one tries to use power,
it will temporarily sap one's strength.

33:31.520 --> 33:33.960
It seems I have underestimated you.

33:34.600 --> 33:37.880
Alright, have you said enough?

33:37.880 --> 33:41.080
Put your sword down.

33:41.080 --> 33:42.720
This is the last warning.

33:42.720 --> 33:44.560
If you don't release Didact now,

33:44.560 --> 33:46.560
you won't go back alive.

33:47.120 --> 33:48.210
Qi.

34:01.800 --> 34:03.840
Retreat! Tactical retreat!

34:14.320 --> 34:15.520
A disorderly mob.

34:17.000 --> 34:18.040
They overrated themselves.

34:24.940 --> 34:28.429
Everyone, please leave our brother.

34:40.639 --> 34:42.159
Qingfei, Xiaoyuan.

34:46.679 --> 34:47.730
So you were waiting for them?

34:48.320 --> 34:51.520
Luo's sudden illness yesterday
was also your doing.

34:51.520 --> 34:53.080
It was to buy time.

34:53.920 --> 34:56.000
Mingxin Fragrance
mixed with Yexiang Flower

34:56.000 --> 34:58.160
can cause the sickly to fall ill.

34:59.560 --> 35:00.880
Thank you for the lesson.

35:01.440 --> 35:04.160
I'll remember this for Zhaoyan.

35:06.160 --> 35:07.240
Release my third brother!

35:20.480 --> 35:22.560
Xiaoyuan, don't forget your mission.

35:22.560 --> 35:23.600
Understood.

35:31.600 --> 35:33.160
(How can she be so strong
at such a young age?)

35:55.680 --> 35:56.720
Careful!

36:05.120 --> 36:07.840
Zhaoyan, are you protecting me?

36:09.040 --> 36:11.200
Senior, now is not the time for chatter.

36:13.120 --> 36:14.800
We will live or die together.

36:22.840 --> 36:23.920
Showy trick!

36:29.320 --> 36:31.080
Huan, let's go.

37:40.320 --> 37:41.460
Qi.

37:56.880 --> 37:57.920
So annoying!

38:09.880 --> 38:10.900
Senior.

38:11.800 --> 38:14.360
Don't be stubborn. You can't defeat her.

38:14.360 --> 38:15.680
I must fight her anyway.

38:18.560 --> 38:21.480
Zhaoyan, I am a demon.

39:15.960 --> 39:17.040
Qi!

39:19.920 --> 39:21.010
Go!

39:24.480 --> 39:25.520
Jinzhao!

39:48.400 --> 39:51.320
♪Looking back♪

39:52.440 --> 39:55.640
♪I try to bring back memories♪

39:56.530 --> 40:00.440
♪We're connected♪

40:00.440 --> 40:02.710
♪It's meant to be♪

40:04.310 --> 40:07.960
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

40:08.470 --> 40:12.280
