40:12.280 --> 40:14.520
♪On a moonlight night♪

40:14.520 --> 40:16.500
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

40:16.500 --> 40:19.220
♪About you♪

40:19.220 --> 40:22.520
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

40:23.220 --> 40:26.610
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

40:27.160 --> 40:29.010
♪The past glided before my mind♪

40:29.010 --> 40:31.250
♪I smiled and cried♪

40:31.250 --> 40:36.500
♪For happiness♪

40:36.500 --> 40:40.400
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

40:40.400 --> 40:44.500
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

40:44.500 --> 40:46.450
♪In this tranquil world♪

40:46.450 --> 40:48.500
♪I've finally found you♪

40:48.500 --> 40:52.530
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

40:52.530 --> 40:56.280
♪I've been looking for you♪

40:56.280 --> 41:00.400
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

41:01.240 --> 41:02.680
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

41:02.680 --> 41:04.950
♪I engrave your name♪

41:04.950 --> 41:10.960
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

